# A New Journey (Windurst 3-3, mission.windurst.a_new_journey). A level 30 Warrior of Windurst in Heaven's Tower with
# the mission current and the Star-Crested Summons (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Status 0: Foo
# Beibo answers his own 87; Kupipi 155; the Vestal Chambers door _6q2 153, whose finish takes the summons, gives the
# Letter to the Ambassador and sets status 1. Status 1: the door says its own VESTAL_CHAMBERS_LOCKED, Kupipi her own
# 251; Foo Beibo 162, Rhy Epocan 160, Ufu Koromoa 161.
lists HeavensTower/_6q2/onTrigger HeavensTower/Foo_Beibo/onTrigger HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/Rhy_Epocan/onTrigger HeavensTower/Ufu_Koromoa/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/153 LowerDelkfuttsTower/_540/onTrade LowerDelkfuttsTower/_540/onTrigger LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/2 RuludeGardens/_6r8/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Pakh_Jatalfih/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/40 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/43 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/141 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/93 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/111 WindurstWoods/Miiri-Wohri/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0.1,30 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
mission Windurst ToEachHisOwnRight completed
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
mission Windurst ANewJourney current
keyitem StarCrestedSummons1
login
trigger Foo_Beibo                       # status 0: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Kupipi+1                        # 155
finish-if-event
trigger _6q2                            # 153
finish                                  # status 1, the summons for the letter to the ambassador
trigger _6q2                            # status 1: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Kupipi+1                        # status 1: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
trigger Foo_Beibo                       # 162
finish-if-event
trigger Rhy_Epocan                      # 160
finish-if-event
trigger Ufu_Koromoa                     # 161
finish-if-event
